@local/dsh-approval-memory README · dsh-approval-memory：A [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai) host plugin that remembers the sandbox-escalation approvals you already gave, so the same operation asks only once per session (default) or per workspace (opt-in).

DSH（DeepSeek Harness）审批记忆插件：沙箱越界重试的审批，同一类操作你点过一次「允许」之后不再反复询问；点过「拒绝」也记住。

它**不做自动审批**，也**不扩大沙箱**：沙箱仍是 `workspace-write`，越界写入照样被拒绝；插件只是复用你对某次越界重试的回答。

